{"id":"exhibicio_n","lemma":"exhibición","pos":"noun","rank":4033,"glosses":["exhibition, show, display"],"ipa":"/eɡsibiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"exhibiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-exhibici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La exhibición ya está abierta.","en":"The exhibition is already open.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551322","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"the act of opening"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"that's it"]]},{"text":"A la exhibición vino todo tipo de personas.","en":"All sorts of people came to the exhibition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693140","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"kind"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"}]},{"text":"La exhibición se llevará a cabo el próximo mes.","en":"The exhibition will be held next month.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"end, edge, extremity"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"near"},{"g":"month"}]},{"text":"A los visitantes se les pide no tocar las exhibiciones.","en":"Visitors are requested not to touch the exhibits.","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"visitor","l":"visitante"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to touch"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El festival terminó con una espectacular exhibición de fuegos artificiales.","en":"The celebrations culminated in a spectacular fireworks display.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"festival"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"spectacular"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"fireworks display"]]}]}